  m_text: "- Be quiet. Granny hears everything.\n- Grandpa doesn't hear very well, but he has a shotgun.\n- Hold (F) to free yourself from beartraps.\n- Utilize hiding spots, such as hiding under beds, tables, holes and other spots in the house.\n- To earn ingame coins, you must escape from the house. Harder difficulties give you more.\n- To have an ingame timer, make sure to press \"L\"."
